{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bDIgNFCwHz1793700734.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今年是孫中山誕辰160周年，灣仔會展舉辦相關研討會。</p><p></p><p>同場亦設孫中山史蹟展，搜羅多幅孫中山在辛亥革命時期的相片及文獻等資料，展館面積達2,000平方米，介紹孫中山從振興中華到民族復興的生平。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SUN-1600.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026S837VcPqbE1793700762.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SUN-1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TdIr1QgUKb1793700774.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>政務司副司長卓永興在研討會致辭，表示孫中山在香港求學時期，思想逐漸由「醫人」，昇華到「醫國」，展覽和研討會令歷史成為可親近、可思考，讓孫中山精神，融入市民日常生活與價值認同。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SUN-1600_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LxSQYd7toE1793700751.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:58.264753+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:38:29.044155+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:43.183915+00:00","content_hash":"c2d9e92f788b8cdd7e5cf7e319f6ab9200292f3b81791b6de4fe7b0121bb5c20","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}